GameAnalytics offers AnalyticsIQ for real-time player analytics, PipelineIQ for raw data access and managed data pipelines, and MarketIQ for market and creative intelligence. Creative intelligence is where GameAnalytics goes deepest. Ad Insights, the creative intelligence platform within MarketIQ Pro, covers 3 billion+ ad creatives across 160+ ad networks and 148 countries, and lets UA and creative teams search ads by what is inside them rather than by metadata alone. The platform supports all major game engines including Unity, Unreal, Godot, GameMaker, Cocos2d, Defold, Construct, and Roblox, with native SDKs for C#, C++, JavaScript, Android, iOS, and tvOS.

GameAnalytics integrates with leading attribution platforms (Adjust, AppsFlyer, Singular, Tenjin, Kochava, Airbridge), ad monetization networks (AdMob, AppLovin MAX, IronSource), data warehouses and BI tools (BigQuery, Looker, Tableau, PowerBI, Metabase), and AI assistants and developer tools (ChatGPT, Claude, Claude Code, Gemini, Perplexity, Cursor, Codex) via the GameAnalytics MCP Server. The platform is ISO/IEC 27001 certified, SOC 2 Type II compliant, ePrivacy certified, and KidSAFE+ certified, and operates as a designated data processor under the GDPR.

