## Products

- [AnalyticsIQ](https://www.gameanalytics.com/analyticsiq): Real-time game analytics with dashboards, funnels, cohort analysis, health monitoring, and custom event tracking. Free tier available; Pro at $29/mo (annual).

Best for:

- AnalyticsIQ (free): Hobby, leisure, student, start-up projects.
- AnalyticsIQ Pro (paid): Professional teams (registered company) and small-sized developers needing advanced analytics.

- [PipelineIQ](https://www.gameanalytics.com/pipelineiq): Raw data access, managed data pipelines, BigQuery data warehouse, APIs, data export, and the GameAnalytics MCP Server for conversational AI queries. From $499/mo.

Best for:

- PipelineIQ Pro (paid): Scale-up, growth-stage, and mid-to-enterprise sized studios with a dedicated Data Team that need raw data access and flexible pipeline control.

- [MarketIQ](https://www.gameanalytics.com/marketiq): App store intelligence and market benchmarks on the free tier. MarketIQ Pro includes Ad Insights, the creative intelligence platform for ad performance, creative analysis, competitor discovery, and download and revenue data. $299/mo (annual) with 10 seats included.

Best for:

- MarketIQ (free): Hobby, leisure, student, and start-up projects researching markets and competitors needing App Store intelligence and mobile game benchmarks.
- MarketIQ Pro (paid): Scale-up and growth-stage teams, and mid-to-enterprise sized studios running paid acquisition strategies, who need deeper competitive intelligence and ad creative benchmarking.

