## Features

- [AnalyticsIQ](https://www.gameanalytics.com/analyticsiq):

AnalyticsIQ (Free):

- Pre-defined Dashboards: Out-of-the-box reporting on standard game data.
- Custom Dashboards: Personalize your dashboards for tailored reporting.
- Pre-defined Events: Out-of-the-box KPIs on the most popular game metrics.
- Design & Custom Events: Configure and track the events that matter most to you.
- Offline Events: No loss of data when players lose connection. Offline events are synced once players reboot.
- Live Events: See the last 50 events your game has fired. Perfect for troubleshooting after a new update.
- Funnels: Identify friction points affecting player progression/journeys.
- Realtime: Monitor your game's performance as it happens.
- Engagement (Cohorts): View player behaviour grouped by cohorts to identify trends.
- Engagement (Retention): Understand how well players come back after key actions, not just installs.
- Engagement (Matrix): Visualize how widely and how often players interact with events or features.
- Explore: Query your aggregated data within our pre-built interface.
- Health (Errors): Detect, diagnose, and resolve app errors.

AnalyticsIQ Pro (Paid):

- Health (Frames Per Second, Memory and App Boot Time): Monitor performance metrics and optimize speed, stability, and efficiency.
- Distributions: Visualize player metrics as histograms to reveal trends and outliers.
- Hourly Granularity: Zoom in on trends with an hourly breakdown of events.
- Portfolio Overview: View key metrics across your portfolio at first glance.
- Scheduled Reporting: Automated delivery of key game metrics directly to your inbox.
- Retention Triggers: Define start and return events to customize your retention analysis.
- Dashboard Sharing: Share dashboards across all games in your Organization. No duplicating needed.

- [MarketIQ](https://www.gameanalytics.com/marketiq):

MarketIQ (Free):

- Store Intelligence: Learn from top games or keep an eye on the competition.
- Benchmarks: Compare your performance to the market, and optimize your games based on real data.

MarketIQ Pro (Paid):

- Ad Insights: The creative intelligence platform inside MarketIQ Pro, purpose-built for gaming UA and creative teams. Ad Insights covers 3 billion+ ad creatives across 160+ ad networks and 148 countries, surfaces ads launched the same day, and reports performance beyond share of voice, including impressions, duration, engagement, campaign goal, monetization method, and audience demographics. Ad Insights is a separate platform from GameAnalytics game data and can be used on its own.
  - Ad Distribution: Get an overview of any app's campaign trends, ad networks, geos targeted, ad formats and in-depth audience insights.
  - Creative Insights: Access and analyze all creatives launched by any app.
  - Creative Search (Image & Video Search): Find ads by what is inside them, not just by metadata. Upload an image or video to analyze creatives you come across in the wild.
  - Similar Audience Apps: Discover apps with similar audiences and identify new competitors to keep an eye on.
  - App Comparison: Compare revenue and download trends across multiple apps in one view.
  - Download Data: Analyze download data from over 1 million apps.
  - Revenue Data: Analyze revenue data from over 1 million apps.
  - Integrated SDKs: Get an overview of SDKs for any app's Advertising, Attribution and more.
  - Top Promoted: Identify the apps investing most in paid advertising.

- [PipelineIQ](https://www.gameanalytics.com/pipelineiq):

PipelineIQ Pro (Paid):

- Custom Event Fields: Customize game data with an additional 50 event fields.
- Data Warehouse: Feed user-level and aggregated data into a managed BigQuery instance for advanced analyses and reporting.
- Data Export: Get raw, user-level data delivered directly to your AWS or GCS bucket, so you can transform, process and extract data any way you like.
- MetricsAPI: GET pre-processed, aggregated data across all your games for internal dashboards and custom reporting.
- OrganizationAPI: Make programmatic updates to games, studios, and users.
- Game Data Sharing: Access game data from your partner studios.
- MCP Server: Ask your data questions and get instant insights via AI tools like ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, and more. Powered by MetricsAPI.

